{% comment %}
  Por El Deporte — Order confirmation.

  WHERE THIS GOES
  Shopify admin > Settings > Notifications > Customer notifications >
  Order confirmation > Edit code. Replace the whole body.
  "Revert to default" in that editor restores Shopify's version.

  SUBJECT LINE: use order-confirmation.subject.liquid.

  WHAT THIS EMAIL IS FOR
  Thank the community and make the preorder expectation explicit. The jersey
  branch must not promise a production or shipping date. Other merchandise
  keeps its made-to-order message.

  VARIABLES TAKEN FROM THE STOCK TEMPLATE, NOT GUESSED
    {{ order_name }} {{ order_status_url }} {{ customer.first_name }}
    subtotal_line_items, line.final_line_price, line.nested_line_child?
    subtotal_price total_discounts shipping_price tax_price total_price
    total_duties requires_shipping shipping_address billing_address
    shipping_methods / shipping_method  transactions  shop.email
    has_pending_payment buyer_action_required payment_charged_on_fulfillment
    consolidated_estimated_delivery_time delivery_instructions

  DELIBERATELY DROPPED from Shopify's version: B2B payment terms, cash
  rounding, WeChat/Alipay currency notes, split-cart delivery agreements,
  pickup and local delivery. Nested shorts are shown as their own receipt rows;
  no child line may be skipped. Public personalization properties are included.

  KEPT ON PURPOSE: the DE/DK policy PDF attachment block at the very bottom. It
  is a legal requirement for German and Danish buyers, not decoration.
{% endcomment %}

{% assign has_club_jersey = false %}
{% for line in subtotal_line_items %}
  {% if line.product.handle == 'club-jersey' %}
    {% assign has_club_jersey = true %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% comment %} Status line, mirroring the stock template's branches. {% endcomment %}
{% capture status_line %}
  {% if has_pending_payment %}
    {% if buyer_action_required %}
      You will get a confirmation from us once your payment goes through.
    {% else %}
      Your payment is being processed. We will email you the moment it clears.
    {% endif %}
  {% elsif payment_charged_on_fulfillment %}
    We have your order. Your payment method is charged when it is ready to go out.
  {% elsif has_club_jersey %}
    Your Club Jersey preorder is in. Thank you for being part of Por El Deporte.
  {% elsif requires_shipping %}
    We are making it now. You will get tracking by email as soon as it ships.
  {% else %}
    We have your order.
  {% endif %}
{% endcapture %}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Order {{ order_name }}</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#efe7d3;">

    <div style="display:none; font-size:1px; color:#efe7d3; line-height:1px; max-height:0; max-width:0; opacity:0; overflow:hidden;">
      {{ status_line | strip }}
    </div>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#efe7d3;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px 40px 12px;">

          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; max-width:600px; background-color:#f7f0de; border:2px solid #171717; border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden;">

            <!-- Crest + order number -->
            <tr>
              <td bgcolor="#171717" style="background-color:#171717; padding:24px 30px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td width="52" valign="middle">
                      <img src="https://poreldeporte.com/icon-192.png" width="52" height="52" alt="{{ shop.name }}"
                           style="display:block; border:0; width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:12px;" />
                    </td>
                    <td align="right" valign="middle" style="font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c9c2ae;">
                      Order {{ order_name }}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Headline -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:40px 40px 0 40px;">
                <h1 style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:36px; line-height:1.05; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:-0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#171717;">
                  {% if has_club_jersey %}This one<br />means a lot.{% elsif customer.first_name %}Thanks,<br />{{ customer.first_name | escape }}{% else %}Thanks for<br />your order{% endif %}
                </h1>
                <p style="margin:18px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#4a463d;">
                  {{ status_line | strip }}
                </p>
                {% if has_club_jersey %}
                <p style="margin:14px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#4a463d;">
                  We put a lot of love into this jersey. Knowing you chose to wear it
                  means everything to us. Whether you play with us, cheer from the
                  sidelines, or support from miles away, you are part of this club.
                  Thank you for helping us keep this community growing.
                </p>
                {% endif %}
                {% if delivery_instructions != blank %}
                <p style="margin:12px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b665b;">
                  <strong>Delivery notes:</strong> {{ delivery_instructions }}
                </p>
                {% endif %}
                {% if consolidated_estimated_delivery_time and has_club_jersey != true %}
                <p style="margin:12px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b665b;">
                  Estimated delivery <strong style="color:#171717;">{{ consolidated_estimated_delivery_time }}</strong>
                </p>
                {% endif %}
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- CTA -->
            {% if order_status_url %}
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:26px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#171717" style="background-color:#171717; border-radius:999px;">
                      <a href="{{ order_status_url }}"
                         style="display:inline-block; padding:17px 44px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.6px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#f7f0de; text-decoration:none; border-radius:999px;">
                        View your order
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- What happens next -->
            {% if requires_shipping and has_pending_payment != true or has_club_jersey %}
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:34px 40px 0 40px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#a55032;">
                  What happens next
                </p>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                  <tr>
                    <td width="30" valign="top" style="padding:0 0 14px 0; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#a55032;">1</td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 14px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      {% if has_club_jersey %}
                      <strong style="color:#171717;">Check your kit.</strong> Your sizes, name and
                      number are listed below. If something looks off, reply as soon as
                      possible so we can help before production.
                      {% else %}
                      <strong style="color:#171717;">We make it.</strong> Your gear is printed and
                      embroidered for you rather than pulled off a shelf, so give it a few days on the bench.
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td width="30" valign="top" style="padding:0 0 14px 0; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#a55032;">2</td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 14px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      {% if has_club_jersey %}
                      <strong style="color:#171717;">This is a preorder.</strong> The shipping
                      date is still to be confirmed. Your order page has your latest order status.
                      {% else %}
                      <strong style="color:#171717;">We ship it.</strong> Tracking lands in your
                      inbox the moment it leaves. U.S. shipping is free, always.
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td width="30" valign="top" style="font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#a55032;">3</td>
                    <td valign="top" style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      {% if has_club_jersey %}
                      <strong style="color:#171717;">We will send tracking.</strong> You will
                      get an email when your shipment is on its way. We cannot wait to see you in it.
                      {% else %}
                      <strong style="color:#171717;">You wear it in.</strong> It was cut and
                      stitched for you, so it is the only one
                      like it at the pitch.
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- Items -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:34px 40px 0 40px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">
                  Your order
                </p>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  {% for line in subtotal_line_items %}
                  <tr>
                    <td width="84" valign="top" style="padding:0 16px 18px 0;">
                      {% if line.image %}
                        <img src="{{ line | img_url: 'medium' }}" width="84" alt=""
                             style="display:block; border:0; width:84px; height:auto; background-color:#e6dcc4; border-radius:10px;" />
                      {% else %}
                        <div style="width:84px; height:84px; background-color:#e6dcc4; border-radius:10px;">&nbsp;</div>
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 18px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.25; color:#171717; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.3px;">
                        {% if line.presentment_title %}{{ line.presentment_title }}
                        {%- elsif line.title %}{{ line.title }}
                        {%- else %}{{ line.product.title }}{% endif %}
                      </p>
                      {% if line.variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
                      <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4; color:#6b665b;">{{ line.variant.title }}</p>
                      {% endif %}
                      <p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4; color:#6b665b;">Qty {{ line.quantity }}</p>
                      {% for property in line.properties %}
                        {% assign property_first_character = property.first | slice: 0 %}
                        {% if property.last != blank and property_first_character != '_' %}
                        <p style="margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:13px; line-height:1.4; color:#4a463d;">{{ property.first | escape }}: {{ property.last | escape }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                      {% endfor %}
                      {% for allocation in line.discount_allocations %}
                      <p style="margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:13px; line-height:1.4; color:#a55032;">{{ allocation.discount_application.title | escape }} (&minus;{{ allocation.amount | money }})</p>
                      {% endfor %}
                      {% if line.refunded_quantity > 0 %}
                      <p style="margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#a55032;">Refunded</p>
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" align="right" style="padding:0 0 18px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#171717; white-space:nowrap;">
                      {% if line.original_line_price != line.final_line_price %}
                        <span style="display:block; font-weight:normal; font-size:13px; color:#8a8577; text-decoration:line-through;">{{ line.original_line_price | money }}</span>
                      {% endif %}
                      {% if line.final_line_price > 0 %}{{ line.final_line_price | money }}{% else %}Free{% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endfor %}
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Totals -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:6px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:18px 0 6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#6b665b;">Subtotal{% if total_discounts > 0 %} after savings{% endif %}</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:18px 0 6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#171717;">{{ subtotal_price | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% if requires_shipping %}
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:0 0 6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#6b665b;">Shipping</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:0 0 6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#171717;">
                      {% if shipping_price > 0 %}{{ shipping_price | money }}{% else %}Free{% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                  {% if total_duties %}
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:0 0 6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#6b665b;">Duties</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:0 0 6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#171717;">{{ total_duties | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:0 0 14px 0; font-size:14px; color:#6b665b;">Taxes</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:0 0 14px 0; font-size:14px; color:#171717;">{{ tax_price | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:14px 0 0 0; border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">Total</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:14px 0 0 0; border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2; font-size:22px; font-weight:bold; color:#171717;">{{ total_price | money_with_currency }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% if total_discounts > 0 %}
                  <tr>
                    <td></td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:6px 0 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#a55032;">You saved {{ total_discounts | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Community band -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:28px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#a55032; border-radius:12px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:18px 22px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#f7f0de;">
                      {% if has_club_jersey %}
                      From everyone at Por El Deporte, thank you for repping the club
                      and making it what it is. On the field and beyond.<br /><br />
                      With love,<br /><strong>Por El Deporte</strong>
                      {% else %}
                      This one pays for pitch time, balls and the next match. The
                      games have always been free to turn up to, and buying this
                      is what keeps it that way. Thank you.
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Addresses + payment -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:32px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                  <tr>
                    {% if requires_shipping and shipping_address %}
                    <td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:20px 12px 0 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">Shipping to</p>
                      {{ shipping_address | format_address }}
                    </td>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if billing_address %}
                    <td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:20px 0 0 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">Billing</p>
                      {{ billing_address | format_address }}
                    </td>
                    {% endif %}
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    {% if requires_shipping and shipping_methods.size > 0 %}
                    <td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:20px 12px 0 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">Shipping method</p>
                      {%- assign unique_shipping_titles = shipping_methods | map: 'title' | uniq -%}
                      {%- for shipping_title in unique_shipping_titles -%}
                        {{ shipping_title }}{% unless forloop.last %}<br />{% endunless %}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </td>
                    {% elsif requires_shipping and shipping_method %}
                    <td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:20px 12px 0 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">Shipping method</p>
                      {{ shipping_method.title }}
                    </td>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% comment %}
                      Built with a capture, the way the stock template does it, so the
                      heading is printed once rather than once per transaction. An order
                      paid with a gift card plus a card has two, and the naive version
                      renders "Payment" twice.
                    {% endcomment %}
                    {% capture payment_lines %}
                      {% for transaction in transactions %}
                        {% if transaction.status == "success" or transaction.status == "pending" %}
                          {% if transaction.kind == "capture" or transaction.kind == "sale" %}
                            {% if transaction.payment_details.type == "card" %}
                              {{ transaction.payment_details.credit_card_company }} ending {{ transaction.payment_details.credit_card_last_four_digits }}<br />
                            {% elsif transaction.payment_details.gift_card_last_four_digits %}
                              Gift card ending {{ transaction.payment_details.gift_card_last_four_digits }}<br />
                            {% elsif transaction.payment_details.local_payment? %}
                              {{ transaction.payment_details.payment_method_display_name }}<br />
                            {% elsif transaction.gateway_display_name %}
                              {{ transaction.gateway_display_name }}<br />
                            {% endif %}
                          {% endif %}
                        {% endif %}
                      {% endfor %}
                    {% endcapture %}
                    {% comment %} Filters are not allowed inside an if, so strip first. {% endcomment %}
                    {% assign payment_lines_stripped = payment_lines | strip %}
                    <td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:20px 0 0 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a463d;">
                      {% if payment_lines_stripped != "" %}
                        <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">Payment</p>
                        {{ payment_lines }}
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Help -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:30px 40px 40px 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:20px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b665b;">
                      Need help with your order? Reply to this
                      email or write to
                      <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#a55032;">{{ shop.email }}</a>.
                      Please get in touch as soon as possible; changes depend on whether production has started.
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>

          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; max-width:600px;">
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding:24px 24px 0 24px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:1.7; color:#8a8577;">
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Por El Deporte</a>
                &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/collections/all-products" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Shop</a>
                &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/policies/refund-policy" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Returns</a>
                <!-- shopify-shop-marketplace-footer -->
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>

{%- comment -%}
  Legally required for German and Danish buyers: the policies travel with the
  confirmation as PDFs. Carried over from the stock template unchanged.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if billing_address.country_code == 'DE' or billing_address.country_code == 'DK' -%}
  {%- if shop.terms_of_service.body != blank -%}
    {{ shop.terms_of_service | attach_as_pdf: "Terms of service" }}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if shop.refund_policy.body != blank -%}
    {{ shop.refund_policy | attach_as_pdf: "Refund policy" }}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
